### Z4_exec_tab_query
REQ b'GET /exec\t?cmd=id HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: alpha.test\r\nConnection: close\r\n\r\n'
STATUS b'HTTP/1.1 200 OK'
BODY b"PLINE=b'GET /exec\\t?cmd=id HTTP/1.1' | LNTOK=4 SPTOK=3 EXEC=b'uid=1000(mouse9911) gid=1000"
UPSTREAM PLINE=b'GET /exec\t?cmd=id HTTP/1.1' | LNTOK=4 SPTOK=3 EXEC=b'uid=1000(mouse9911) gid=1000(mouse9911) groups=1000(mouse9911),4(adm),24(cdrom),27(sudo),30(dip),46(plugdev),100(users),101(lxd)\n' | CLEN=None BODYLEN=0 BODY=b''

### Z5_two_tabs
